/// offers, visits or milestones for an agent). STOP_OPEN_WORK: what is in
/// flight stops (running orders cancelled and refunded through the refund
/// desk, live campaigns halted, an agent's pending offers released and
/// scheduled visits cancelled). STOP_ACCRUAL: the daily earning skips the
/// listing(s). FREEZE_WALLET: money stops leaving. BLOCK_SIGNIN: sessions are
/// revoked and sign-in refused. Which values a party admits is decided in
/// `suspension.service`; a listing never takes the last two.
